# CQ-04: 矸石固废流产生-利用-处置闭合检查——每个 waste_stream 的产生来源数 vs 利用+处置去向数，不等即未闭合。
# 图约定：全部为断言边（graph:asserted）；COUNT(DISTINCT) 抵消 src×dst 交叉积。
PREFIX eia: <https://ontology.eai-flow.com/eia#>
PREFIX pred: <https://ontology.eai-flow.com/eia#predicate/>
SELECT ?waste (COUNT(DISTINCT ?src) AS ?genN) (COUNT(DISTINCT ?dst) AS ?outN) WHERE {
  GRAPH <graph:asserted> { ?waste a eia:WasteStream }
  OPTIONAL { GRAPH <graph:asserted> { ?src pred:generates_waste ?waste } }
  OPTIONAL {
    GRAPH <graph:asserted> {
      { ?waste pred:utilized_by ?dst } UNION { ?waste pred:disposed_by ?dst }
    }
  }
} GROUP BY ?waste HAVING (COUNT(DISTINCT ?src) != COUNT(DISTINCT ?dst))
